  <section>
    <h2>Why we built it</h2>
    <p>GraphRace Studio is made by a data analyst who works with data every day. Data is more than a collection of numbers — when it’s visualized well, it becomes a powerful way to discover new things and tell stories.</p>
    <p>But presenting data in a way that is both beautiful and easy to understand usually takes special skills and a lot of time. We started this project to make it easy for anyone to visualize data and share it on YouTube, social media and beyond.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to help more people enjoy and share what makes data interesting, and to spark more conversations through data.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who runs it</h2>
    <p>GraphRace Studio is developed and run by an individual data analyst, not a company.</p>
    <p>Type: independent developer<br>Background: data analyst (data analysis and data visualization)</p>
    <p>As a small independent project, we can move quickly and add improvements based on your feedback.</p>
  </section>

